  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium-high.",
    "Add onion and garlic; cook until onion is translucent.",
    "Add ground turkey; cook, breaking up with a spoon, until browned.",
    "Stir in kasha, salt, pepper, and thyme; cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add chicken broth and lemon juice; bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low; simmer, covered, for 15 minutes.",
    "Stir in lemon zest and parsley.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve hot."
